Package: pnpm-deps-completion
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), bash-completion
Recommends: pnpm, zsh
Maintainer: pnpm-deps-completion contributors <maintainer@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/NickolasMuzzi/pnpm-deps-completion
Description: pnpm dependency name completion for bash and zsh
 Completes package names from a project's package.json after pnpm update,
 remove and why, and binaries from node_modules/.bin after pnpm exec.
 Installs completion files read by bash-completion and zsh, plus a
 pnpm-deps command available on PATH.
